  The reel_script says the rituals were held for 'ஜாதக தோஷம் நீங்கவும்' (to remove horoscope dosha), while the article says devotees prayed to be freed from horoscope dosha; the draft's wording is acceptable, but the slides_spec line 'ஜாதக தோஷம் நீங்கவும், நீண்ட ஆரோக்கியம் வேண்டியும் பக்தர்கள்' is an incomplete sentence with no clear verb, so it is not grammatically meaningful.
